message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Fermium Hazard Mapper"
abstract: >-
  An open Python pipeline and web application that trains flood
  susceptibility models on flood extents mapped from Sentinel-1 radar, scores
  every model on whole areas held out from training, and publishes asset-level
  and administrative-level flood and landslide risk for Bangladesh.
